    {
      "component_id": "c_007",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "IMPORTANT NOTES: *ACP can NOT be moved to sdcard! Apps that use alarms and widgets break when doing so. 9/30/14- *Fixed many, many, many bugs *Added Digital Clock widget for lock screen and home screen for android 4.2+ *Fixed problem with ads causing errors *Dropped support for pre2.3 android devices *AD-FREE VERSION NOW ONLY $0.99! Hit more apps below to upgrade *PLEASE RATE THE APP OR SHARE ON FACEBOOK!!!!! 11/17/12- *Fixed many force close errors *Fixed themes on old devices 7/06/12- *Removed many ad placements! *Fixed shake to snooze on many phones *Added new timepicker for ICS phones *Added set button to color pickers *Fixed shake to snooze on many phones *Many other bug fixes Reason for permissions used: *Wake Lock - Keeps phone on when alarm sounds *Disable Keyguard - Unlocks phone when alarm sounds *Write External Storage - Allows settings to be backed up *Phone State - So alarm doesn't sound loud while on the phone *Network State - Required by Ad Providers *Flashlight - To flash the flashligh when alarm sounds *Internet - Weather/Ads 2/06/12- *All ICS bugs should now be fixed! 1/30/12- *Fixed more ICS bugs... *Users running ICS, disable force gpu rendering to fix alarm screen (until next update) *Next update currently testing, scheduled to be released 2/5 1/29/12- *Updates for ICS, some bug fixes *Dim button removed... Now just tap background to dim *Tapping the clock now opens alarms screen 11/17/11- *Added option in alarms to set alarm volume independent or not *Turned off auto launch when plugged in by default *Test Alarms now run immediately *Many,many,many bug fixes, with redundent failovers in the code 8/7/11- *Gentle alarms now increase volume less drastically *Clicking digits when setting alarm time will auto clear them *Flashlight functionality now brightly flashes screen *Music button now defaults correctly on htc phones *Many,many,many bug fixes -Thanks goes out to all the users out there! Another 2 weeks and I'll be done with school forever! Another update coming in the next month or two adding new big features!. 6/5/11- *Hopefully fixed lock screen and alert window disappearing bug *Sorry for all the recent updates, I've been on a massive bug fix quest 6/1/11- *Set Alarm via Google Voice Command for Android 2.3+ *Fixed bug with math blank math problems. *Fixed bug with widgets 5/30/11- *Updated translations. Added Finnish. *Many many bug fixes. 5/12/11- *Added option to override language, see button below. *Fixed font labels. 5/10/11- *Added confirmation when checking skip next occurrence. *Added hardware dim toggle for deskclock dim mode. *Updated translations. *Minor bug fixes. 3/9/11- *Added ability for one time skip repeating alarms (push and hold alarms to skip). *Added option to use camera flash when alarm is triggered (might not work on all phones). *Added option to disable chimes while ringer is muted. *Finally fixed FC errors for MUIU firmware! 1/14- *More bug fixes for 1.5/1.6 devices.",
